"{\"title\":\"Secrets Of The Shadows\",\"desc\":\"Secrets of the Shadows is a mod with a focus on exploring dungeons throughout your world! Many secrets can be found hidden in these long forgotten locations of old.\\n\\nIf you find any issues with SOTS, the Discord server is the best place to find help.\\nDiscord Server Invite Link[discord.gg]\\n\\nWiki has been moved to wiki.gg\\nUnfinished Wiki[terrariamods.wiki.gg]\\nSOTS Texture Pack\\n\\n!! This mod is in development, and will continue to be supported for the foreseeable future !!\\n!! A large world is HIGHLY recommended to avoid major structures overlapping !!\\n!! Worldgen may not work on special seeds !!\\n\\nThis mod contains:\\n8 new bosses with unique attacks\\n11 new armor sets with interesting set bonuses\\n1000+ new items with many interesting effects, and 3 new ores with unique mechanics\\n4 new major structures to explore: the Planetarium, Pyramid, Abandoned Village, and Sanctuary\\nMany new mini structures that add life to Terraria\\nA new damage class, Void, which lets you utilize the power of your soul\\nWarriors, Rangers, Mages, and Summoners can all have void weapons at their disposal\\nMany new furniture sets to scratch your creative itch\\n\\n~Developers~\\nCode, Direction, Art: Vortex\\nDirection, Art: Taco\\nCode: DylanDoe21, apotofkoolaid\\nArt: Astrobit, Petaniks, kekcroc\\nMusic: BananaLizard, YuriO\\nMusic, SFX, Art: Heart Plus Up!\\n\\n~Special Thanks, Testers, and Contributors~\\nBlasfah, Mochi, HugeKraken, EduaRRdo, Arcri, Lunatix, Cloud, SpicySpaceSnake, Pokerface, Moonseer, Lacewing, Linnnnnna,\\nENNWAY, Ramen, Mushnib~, Dreadsoul, Crimsonkeep, Bman, TheorR, Sovergi\\nOriginally posted by tModLoader SOTS:\\nDeveloped By Vortex Of Rainbows\",\"stats\":\"276.171 MB | 31 Jul, 2022 @ 10:37pm | 26 Jul @ 4:13am\",\"tags\":\"\"}"
